{"id":1263620,"shortDescription":"¡Crea tu propia flota de yates! Encuentra viejos yates, repara sus cascos, arregla sus motores y añádeles nuevas piezas. Diseña e instala el interior de tus embarcaciones. Navega con tus barcos y prueba como aguantan en el agua. Vendes tus yates, gana dinero, ¡y conviértete en millonario!","developers":["Punch Punk Games"],"publishers":["CreativeForge Games S.A.","PlayWay S.A."],"categories":["Un jugador","Compat. parcial con mando","Préstamo familiar"],"releaseDateRaw":"28 JUL 2022","background":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1263620/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1782669422","screenshots":[{"thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1263620/ss_7d844f0bea199e330bc51d9f90fe83eb88aa0aae.600x338.jpg?t=1782669422","full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1263620/ss_7d844f0bea199e330bc51d9f90fe83eb88aa0aae.1920x1080.jpg?t=1782669422"},{"thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1263620/ss_c1557ebf916be9a978406f60f708528dfba34ad2.600x338.jpg?t=1782669422","full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1263620/ss_c1557ebf916be9a978406f60f708528dfba34ad2.1920x1080.jpg?t=1782669422"},{"thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1263620/ss_76ca2543e3b1a66ef5eb5c06f19b535b61fd1d9f.600x338.jpg?t=1782669422","full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1263620/ss_76ca2543e3b1a66ef5eb5c06f19b535b61fd1d9f.1920x1080.jpg?t=1782669422"},{"thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1263620/ss_8242c3b378bdb4cdd898297bebd227130af56a7d.600x338.jpg?t=1782669422","full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1263620/ss_8242c3b378bdb4cdd898297bebd227130af56a7d.1920x1080.jpg?t=1782669422"},{"thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1263620/ss_20ec07b9f61